# Zxk <lineag896@gmail.com>
# Xiaomi QCACLD WCN3990 port
#
# qcacld fix work & port for clover(wcn3990) since no devices currently use qcacld
# - updates QDF timers, locks, refcounts, netdev, NAPI, procfs, and cfg80211
#   interfaces for current kernel APIs;
# - keeps the vendor Kbuild feature profile and module dependency structure;
# - ports SMMU/IOMMU handling and guards IPA-only assumptions;
# - constrains non-64-bit HTT DMA to 32 bits so firmware receives complete
#   fragment addresses;
# - fixes size_t trace formatting and related transmit-path compatibility.
#
# functions:
# - qdf_mc_timer_*: dispatch modern timer_list callbacks with QDF context.
# - hif_snoc_enable_bus/hif_set_dma_coherent_mask: configure SNOC DMA safely.
# - pld_snoc_* and CDS SMMU helpers: use Linux 6.19 IOMMU APIs.
# - HDD/cfg80211/NAPI adapters: bridge vendor callbacks to current interfaces.
